OL,3,GNEWSAPolice expand search for woman
OL,4,Amissing for 10 days
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe search for a woman who went missing
OL,7,F10 days ago is now focussing on the
OL,8,FLytham, St Annes, Fairhaven, Blackpool
OL,9,Fand Fylde coast areas of Lancashire,
OL,10,Fpolice have said.
OL,12,FEren Wright, 29, was last seen at about
OL,13,F10:00 GMT on 27 October on St David's
OL,14,FRoad South in Lytham.
OL,16,FShe is described as white, 5ft 7in
OL,17,F(1.7m) tall, slim, with blonde hair and
OL,18,Ftattoos of vines and a tree on her hand
OL,19,Fand arm.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
